# Normalize line endings: LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# The committed blobs are LF and Biome (which enforces formatting) expects LF.
# Without this, Windows checkouts smudge files to CRLF and `npm run
# format:check` fails with dozens of phantom whitespace diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalize binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.wasm binary
*.zip binary